{"page":1,"results_per_page":20,"results_size":1,"total_results_size":1,"total_pages":1,"next_page":null,"prev_page":null,"results":[{"id":"aRNMOhAAACkAdwgI","uid":"gold-run","url":null,"type":"news","href":"https://toyfight.cdn.prismic.io/api/v2/documents/search?ref=ar0VLREAACcAMgk6&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aRNMOhAAACkAdwgI%22%29+%5D%5D","tags":[],"first_publication_date":"2025-11-11T14:55:56+0000","last_publication_date":"2026-01-28T10:58:12+0000","slugs":["awards-mentions--momentum"],"linked_documents":[],"lang":"en-gb","alternate_languages":[],"data":{"title":"We're on a winning run","heading_colours":[{"word_index":0,"word_colour":"#FFF490"},{"word_index":3,"word_colour":"#E9E3F3"}],"banner_image":{"dimensions":{"width":2592,"height":1600},"alt":"More Wins","copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/toyfight/aRSNsbpReVYa4YbA_ArticleImage-WINS.jpg?auto=format,compress","id":"aRSNsbpReVYa4YbA","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}},"banner_video_url":null,"date_string":"November, 2025","thumbnail":{},"thumbnail_video":null,"related_news":{"id":"Z1gp6RIAACEAVSqv","type":"news","tags":[],"lang":"en-gb","slug":"fresh-faces-join-toyfight","first_publication_date":"2024-12-10T11:51:15+0000","last_publication_date":"2024-12-10T12:08:20+0000","uid":"fresh-faces-2024","link_type":"Document","key":"52a9d6b1-f131-40b0-85fc-3869c630d69e","isBroken":false},"slices":[{"variation":"default","version":"initial","items":[],"primary":{"content":[{"type":"heading4","text":"Awards, Mentions & Momentum","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"It’s been a great few weeks back at ToyFight. With back-to-back launches, glowing feedback, and a few shiny things on the digital mantelpiece, we’re feeling the flow and having a fun ride.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]},"id":"news_content$807e16d1-8e3b-4706-82fd-3d10f893a552","slice_type":"news_content","slice_label":null},{"variation":"default","version":"initial","items":[],"primary":{"content":[{"type":"heading4","text":"Awwwards Wins Galore","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"We were delighted to discover that three of our recent projects INK Games, Pantheon Media Group, and Metropolis have picked up Awwwards SOTD for their design, UX, innovation, and overall experience. Big shout to our friends at Datum also, whose AI-driven CRE platform received an Honourable Mention. Smart tech, sharp design, and only just getting started.","spans":[{"start":64,"end":73,"type":"hyperlink","data":{"link_type":"Web","url":"https://www.awwwards.com/sites/ink-games","target":"_blank"}},{"start":75,"end":95,"type":"hyperlink","data":{"link_type":"Web","url":"https://www.awwwards.com/sites/pantheon-media-group","target":"_blank"}},{"start":101,"end":111,"type":"hyperlink","data":{"link_type":"Web","url":"https://www.awwwards.com/sites/metropolis-test-drive","target":"_blank"}},{"start":227,"end":232,"type":"hyperlink","data":{"link_type":"Web","url":"https://www.awwwards.com/sites/datum","target":"_blank"}}],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pantheon was also featured in an article on Awwwards, where we deep-dived into the build, the motion principles, and the madness that made it happen.","spans":[{"start":44,"end":52,"type":"hyperlink","data":{"link_type":"Web","url":"https://www.awwwards.com/pantheon.html","target":"_blank"}}],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]},"id":"news_content$1b6a2317-120b-4926-a49a-83d1d67cf918","slice_type":"news_content","slice_label":null},{"variation":"default","version":"initial","items":[],"primary":{"content":[{"type":"heading4","text":"GSAP Showcase & Site of the Month","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"To add more joy, Pantheon was also selected as a GSAP Featured Showcase and awarded GSAP Site of the Month — a massive honour from the motion masters themselves. ","spans":[{"start":49,"end":71,"type":"hyperlink","data":{"link_type":"Web","url":"https://gsap.com/showcase/","target":"_self"}}],"direction":"ltr"}]},"id":"news_content$9acb79d3-fcd4-49de-91eb-570f8800712b","slice_type":"news_content","slice_label":null},{"variation":"default","version":"initial","items":[],"primary":{"content":[{"type":"heading4","text":"What This Means","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This isn’t just about awards (though we’re not complaining). It’s about doing consistently great work with great people. Collaborating closely. Sweating the details. And staying brave enough to do things differently.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"As ever we’re grateful to all our clients, and the folks who seem to like us, and if the last few months are anything to go by, this run’s nowhere near over.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Stay tuned to what’s next.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]},"id":"news_content$a2f2eb58-36df-4104-a887-03db8c0e88d3","slice_type":"news_content","slice_label":null},{"variation":"default","version":"initial","items":[],"primary":{"content":[{"type":"heading4","text":"Explore more ","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Take a closer look at the projects ","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ink Games","spans":[{"start":0,"end":9,"type":"hyperlink","data":{"link_type":"Web","url":"https://inkgames.com/","target":"_blank"}}],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pantheon","spans":[{"start":0,"end":8,"type":"hyperlink","data":{"link_type":"Web","url":"https://www.pantheonmedia.com/","target":"_blank"}}],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Metropolis","spans":[{"start":0,"end":10,"type":"hyperlink","data":{"link_type":"Web","url":"https://testdrive.metropolis.io/","target":"_blank"}}],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Datum","spans":[{"start":0,"end":5,"type":"hyperlink","data":{"link_type":"Web","url":"https://datum.xyz/","target":"_blank"}}],"direction":"ltr"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]},"id":"news_content$86cda917-d57b-4c0a-87bf-58af84b95e10","slice_type":"news_content","slice_label":null}],"meta_description":"From Awwwards wins for INK Games, Pantheon & Metropolis to an Honourable Mention for Datum, ToyFight is on a roll—delivering bold, original work that’s turning heads.","meta_image":{},"meta_title":"ToyFight Wins Big | Awwwards Successes & Creative Momentum"}}],"version":"9eb0c14","license":"All Rights Reserved"}